<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rates up, 6-mth flat.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rates up, 6-mth flat.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) edged up on Friday for one- and three-month maturities and was flat for six months, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.51 percent, up 0.01 percent, the three-month rate at 20.13 percent, up 0.04 percent, and the six-month rate unchanged at 19.70 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
